{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02753","headline":"中和乐九章 总歌第九 · 卢照邻","name":"中和乐九章 总歌第九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明明天子兮圣德扬，穆穆皇后兮阴化康。\n登若木兮坐明堂，池蒙汜兮家扶桑。\n武化偃兮文化昌，礼乐昭兮股肱良。\n君臣已定兮君永无疆，颜子更生兮徒皇皇。\n若有人兮天一方，忠爲衣兮信爲裳。\n飡白玉兮饮琼芳，心思荃兮路阻长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02753.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02753","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}